    puts stderr {Target : x86_64_v3}
    puts stderr {}
    puts stderr {This package provides an implementation of "object interfaces" for}
    puts stderr {Python. Interfaces are a mechanism for labeling objects as conforming to}
    puts stderr {a given API or contract. So, this package can be considered as}
    puts stderr {implementation of the Design By Contract methodology support in Python.}
}

